#: ../interfaces.py:83
msgid "API Version"
msgstr "Versione API"

#: ../controlpanel.py:10
msgid "In order to use ReCaptcha v2 on your Plone site, go to https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/ to create an account and to receive your private and public key. Then configure them at https://host/path/to/site/@@recaptcha-settings. If you don't want to rely on an external service for captcha, you might want to consider using plone.formwidget.captcha instead."
msgstr "Per usare ReCaptcha v2 sul tuo sito Plone, vai su https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/ per creare un account e ricevere la tua chiave privata e la tua chiave pubblica. Poi configurale su https://host/path/to/site/@@recaptcha-settings. Se non vuoi dipendere da un servizio esterno per il captcha, puoi valutare l'uso di plone.formwidget.captcha."

#: ../interfaces.py:97
msgid "Minimum score for v3 validation (0.0 - 1.0). Recommended: 0.5"
msgstr "Punteggio minimo per la validazione v3 (0,0 - 1,0). Consigliato: 0,5"

